        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> god </STYLE>: their drink <gr str="5262">offerings </gr>of <gr str="4480 1818">blood </gr>will I <gr str="1077">not </gr>
        <gr str="5258">offer</gr>, <gr str="1077">nor </gr>take <gr str="5375">up </gr>
        <gr str="*853" />their <gr str="8034">names </gr>
        <gr str="5921">into </gr>my <gr str="8193">lips</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="5"> The <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE> the <gr str="4521">portion </gr>of mine <gr str="2506">inheritance </gr>and of my <gr str="3563">cup</gr>: <gr str="859">thou </gr>
        <gr str="8551">maintainest </gr>my <gr str="1486">lot</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6"> The <gr str="2256">lines </gr>are <gr str="5307">fallen </gr>unto me in <gr str="5273">pleasant </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> places </STYLE>; <gr str="637">yea</gr>, I <gr str="5921">have </gr>a <gr str="8231">goodly </gr>
        <gr str="5159">heritage</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="7"> I will <gr str="1288">bless </gr>
        <gr str="*853" />the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, <gr str="834">who </gr>hath given me <gr str="3289">counsel</gr>: my <gr str="3629">reins </gr>
        <gr str="637">also </gr>
        <gr str="3256">instruct </gr>me in the night <gr str="3915">seasons</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="8"> I have <gr str="7737">set </gr>the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>
